: check ( got expected -- ) 2dup = if 2drop ." ok " else ." FAIL " swap (.) ."  expected " (.) cr abort then ;
mkdict constant D
7 0 D s" a" mkstr 2 d-set   D s" a" mkstr 2 d-get 1 check 0 check 7 check
D s" b" mkstr 2 d-get 0 check 2drop
D d-count 1 check
: fill-d 100 0 begin 2dup > while dup 10 * 0 D 3 pick 0 d-set 1+ repeat 2drop ;
fill-d  D d-count 101 check  D d.cap 256 check
D 42 0 d-get 1 check 0 check 420 check   D s" a" mkstr 2 d-get 1 check 0 check 7 check  D 100 0 d-get 0 check 2drop
D 42 0 d-del 1 check  D 42 0 d-get 0 check 2drop  D d-count 100 check  D 42 0 d-del 0 check
99 0 D 42 0 d-set D 42 0 d-get 1 check 0 check 99 check D d-count 101 check
D 1.0 1 d-get 1 check 0 check 10 check    D 1 5 d-get 1 check 0 check 10 check
D 0 d-next swap . . cr
cr ." dict ok" cr bye
